<component #resource_core.single_file_loader apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "component" behaviors = ["behavior://resource-loading/requirements/single-file-resource-formats"] } (
  <desc ?01M0VHVQHVD106SMDHN4SVDP74>
  按 authority 文件格式把 single-file catalog 的 XNL 或 Markdown frontmatter 规范化为统一 ResourceRecord，并以完整原始 bytes 建立内容身份。
  </?01M0VHVQHVD106SMDHN4SVDP74>
  <runtime ?runtime>
  interface SingleFileRuntime { readFile(path: string): Promise&lt;Uint8Array&gt; }
  </?runtime>
  <input ?input>
  interface SingleFileInput { filePath: string; sourceShape: "single-file"; expectedKind: string }
  </?input>
  <config ?config>
  interface SingleFileConfig { formats: readonly ["xnl", "markdown"]; markdownIdentityField: "metadata.fqn" }
  </?config>
  <output ?output>
  type SingleFileOutput = ResourceRecord | ResourceDiagnostic[]
  </?output>
  <pseudo { kind = "ctrl" } ?ctrl>
  读取一次 raw bytes → 按扩展名解析 XNL 或闭合 Markdown frontmatter → 规范化 identity/metadata/spec/provenance → 校验 Kind/API version → 以同一 raw bytes 生成 authority digest
  </?ctrl>
  <not-owned-here ?01M0VHVQHVD106SMDHN4SVDP75>
  不从 Markdown 正文推断 dependency，不拥有 ApplicationSOP 等消费方 Kind 语义。
  </?01M0VHVQHVD106SMDHN4SVDP75>
)>

<component #resource_core.semantic_catalog_loader apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "component" behaviors = ["behavior://resource-loading/requirements/semantic-resource-catalogs"] } (
  <desc ?01M0VYNA4K9H1CX8604TK109VC>
  把语义根与 Catalogs 规范化为结构资源发现计划；先 bootstrap KindDefinitions，再校验并注册根资源，且不解释任何代码运行语言。
  </?01M0VYNA4K9H1CX8604TK109VC>
  <runtime ?runtime>
  interface SemanticCatalogRuntime { readFile(path: string): Promise&lt;Uint8Array&gt;; readDirectory(path: string): Promise&lt;readonly DirectoryEntry[]&gt;; realpath(path: string): Promise&lt;string&gt; }
  </?runtime>
  <input ?input>
  interface ResourceCatalogInput { rootManifest: ResourceRecord; catalogs: readonly ResourceCatalogDeclaration[] }
  </?input>
  <config ?config>
  interface ResourceCatalogConfig { tags: readonly ["FileResourceCatalog", "DirectoryResourceCatalog", "ManifestResourceCatalog", "Catalog"]; directoryScope: "root" | "children" }
  </?config>
  <output ?output>
  type ResourceCatalogOutput = LoadedResourceTree | readonly ResourceDiagnostic[]
  </?output>
  <pseudo { kind = "ctrl" } ?ctrl>
  解析根 → 规范化 Catalog declarations → 优先加载 KindDefinitions → 校验语义根并注册 → 按 tag shape 与 scope 枚举结构资源 → 校验 expected/self-described Kind → 冻结 registry
  </?ctrl>
  <not-owned-here ?01M0VYNA4K9H1CX8604TK109VD>
  Bundle materialization、语言 adapter、代码执行、capability 注入和 leaf admission 均由 consumer Host 拥有。
  </?01M0VYNA4K9H1CX8604TK109VD>
)>

<component #resource_core.resource_material_reader apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "component" behaviors = ["behavior://resource-loading/requirements/directory-resource-materials"] } (
  <desc ?01M0W00M8P7BF8ZV7K7MSED77P>
  从 authentic directory ResourceRecord 的 owner boundary 读取显式 VFS material，并输出 target-neutral digest contribution；不拥有执行或 admission。
  </?01M0W00M8P7BF8ZV7K7MSED77P>
  <runtime ?runtime>
  interface ResourceMaterialRuntime { lstat(path: string): Promise&lt;FileStat&gt;; realpath(path: string): Promise&lt;string&gt;; readFile(path: string): Promise&lt;Uint8Array&gt; }
  </?runtime>
  <input ?input>
  interface ReadResourceMaterialInput { tree: LoadedResourceTree; rootDir: string; resourceId: string; uri: `vfs://./${string}` }
  </?input>
  <config ?config>
  interface ResourceMaterialConfig { sourceShape: "directory"; symlink: "reject"; digest: "sha256" }
  </?config>
  <output ?output>
  type ReadResourceMaterialOutput = Promise&lt;ResourceMaterial&gt;; type Failure = throws ResourceMaterialError
  </?output>
  <pseudo { kind = "ctrl" } ?ctrl>
  验证 authentic tree/resource → 从 logicalPath 派生 owner directory → 校验 lexical URI → lstat/realpath containment → 读取 bytes → 摘要并冻结 material/contribution
  </?ctrl>
  <not-owned-here ?01M0W00M8P7BF8ZV7K7MSED77Q>
  Bundle runtime、Bun/Python/Java adapter、module import、capability 与 leaf admission 属于 Host。
  </?01M0W00M8P7BF8ZV7K7MSED77Q>
)>

<component #resource_core.resource_package_read_port apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "component" behaviors = ["behavior://resource-loading/requirements/resource-package-read-port"] } (
  <desc ?01M1C7READPORT0000000000020>
  为 ResourcePackage semantic loader 提供 storage-neutral 文件视图；provider coordinate 只用于读取，输出 provenance 始终由 package-relative coordinate 生成。
  </?01M1C7READPORT0000000000020>
  <runtime ?runtime>
  interface ResourcePackageReadPort { stat(path: string): Awaitable&lt;ResourcePackageEntry | undefined&gt;; readDirectory(path: string): Awaitable&lt;readonly ResourcePackageDirectoryEntry[] | undefined&gt;; readBytes(path: string): Awaitable&lt;Uint8Array | undefined&gt; }
  </?runtime>
  <input ?input>
  interface ResourcePackageReadSource { port: ResourcePackageReadPort; rootPath: string; manifestPath?: string }
  </?input>
  <config ?config>
  interface ReadPortPolicy { path: "canonical-posix-absolute"; provenance: "package-relative"; providerOrder: "ignored"; partialTree: "reject" }
  </?config>
  <output ?output>
  type ResourcePackageReadOutput = LoadedResourceTree | readonly ResourceDiagnostic[]
  </?output>
  <pseudo { kind = "ctrl" } ?ctrl>
  规范化 rootPath 与 manifestPath → 仅向 port 请求 containment 内路径 → 稳定排序目录 entries → 读取一次 authority bytes → 复用同一 parser/validator/digest 链 → 以 package-relative path 生成 provenance
  </?ctrl>
  <not-owned-here ?01M1C7READPORT0000000000021>
  overlay materialization、BunFS/xnl-vfs adapter、Eidolon authority、资源业务 Kind 与执行 admission 均由调用方或既有 owner 管理。
  </?01M1C7READPORT0000000000021>
)>
